    "_convention": "One scene-spec JSON per script, saved alongside it as <script-name>.scenes.json. Each beat's `duration` is intentionally omitted -- build_video.js fills it in at render time from the ACTUAL measured length of that beat's generated narration WAV.",
    "_note": "Transnistria is a breakaway region of Moldova, not its own polygon in country-codes.json/world-atlas, so highlight stays [\"MD\"] for context and a hand-drawn `lines` loop approximates the narrow strip along the Dniester River (roughly Camenca in the north to Tiraspol/Slobozia in the south), per README's 'scenes that aren't a country' pattern."
  },
